A wildcard final segment addresses the files themselves, so each row is slugged by its own
stem — the very same `index.md` that `an-index-pattern-slugs-by-the-directory-name` slugs
`alpha` comes back as `index` here.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/alpha/index.md --
---
title: Alpha
---

body
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/alpha/roadmap.md --
---
title: Roadmap
---

body
-- cmd --
booping query --glob 'plans/*/*.md' --columns slug
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
| slug | path |
| --- | --- |
| index | plans/alpha/index.md |
| roadmap | plans/alpha/roadmap.md |
-- stderr --
